  "player_text": "I follow his glance to the stern figure managing the crowd. I walk over and ask that person, directly, what it takes for a traveler to get through this gate.",
  "visible_motivation": "The runner still answered instead of the guard, then looked toward the stern figure managing the crowd and stopped. That person looks like the one actually running the line.",
  "intended_meaning": "Ask the stern figure managing the crowd how a traveler gets through the gate.",
  "generated_candidate": "You approach the stern figure managing the crowd, a guard captain who keeps a sharp eye on the scene. When you ask directly what it takes for a traveler to get through the gate, the guard captain's gaze sharpens. \"These days,\" they say, \"it's more than just coin or papers. With the patrol missing and tensions high, we need solid reasons, sometimes proof of connections, or a willingness to pay the proper toll. Each day’s conditions change with the rumors and orders from above. If you have the right allies or can make your case convincingly, you might get through—otherwise, patience and persistence are your best options.\"",
